nt Stage two TextBlock items with identical source but different text and labels. Determine whether the second is intentionally a replacement or is silently lost. The current identity reducer hashes source kind plus source and ignores content and label; report this only after confirming the source uniqueness contract. attachment-0001-0780b6cb8cffb4c… Save/reload Pending items, failed items, retry payloads, and immutable receipts must have deliberate persistence behavior. Quick AI must persist none of them. Export No raw provider diagnostics, hidden prompt prefix, private path, secret, failed-context detail, or Quick AI retained transcript. Preflight audit Two equal-length but different drafts must not be represented as the same identity if any consumer uses the field for freshness/correlation. Concurrent append/compaction must not corrupt the JSONL log. Malformed entries may be skipped only with a diagnostic receipt. Portal cancellation Dismissal or unsupported host must restore composer text and caret and clear pending portal state. Work package 4 — Agent Chat thread, view, popups, setup, transcript, and export Owned paths src/ai/agent_chat/ui/chat_window.rs src/ai/agent_chat/ui/components/setup_card.rs src/ai/agent_chat/ui/components/transcript.rs src/ai/agent_chat/ui/conversation_export.rs src/ai/agent_chat/ui/history_popup.rs src/ai/agent_chat/ui/mod.rs src/ai/agent_chat/ui/popup_automation.rs src/ai/agent_chat/ui/popup_registry.rs src/ai/agent_chat/ui/popup_window.rs src/ai/agent_chat/ui/style_contract.rs src/ai/agent_chat/ui/tests.rs src/ai/agent_chat/ui/thread.rs src/ai/agent_chat/ui/thread/tests.rs src/ai/agent_chat/ui/types.rs src/ai/agent_chat/ui/view.rs src/ai/agent_chat/ui/view/portal_host.rs Extract the branch evidence Zshgit diff --find-renames --find-copies --function-context \ main...HEAD -- $(sed -n '4,19p' "$lane/owned-paths.txt") \ > "$lane/diffs/40-agent-chat-ui.patch" git log --reverse \ --format='%H%x09%ad%x09%s' --date=iso-strict \ main..HEAD 