receipts/00-owned-name-status.tsv\` - \`receipts/00-missing-owned-paths.txt\` ## Rule No production path may be edited. Any scope drift, missing path, unexpected branch, or changed campaign baseline stops this lane before substantive review. EOF if [[ "$scope_gate" != "PASS" ]]; then printf '\nScope drift detected; manager takeover required.\n' >&2 exit 2 fi The worker’s first evidence is therefore: receipts/00-preexisting-worktree.txt receipts/00-owned-name-status.tsv 00-inventory.md Do not require a clean tree. Record and preserve all pre-existing work. 2. Required lane artifact layout Create only this structure: .notes/oracle/branch-trust-audit/lanes/03-ai-protocol/ ├── 00-inventory.md ├── 01-path-accounting.tsv ├── 02-audit-report.md ├── 03-findings.jsonl ├── 04-verification.md ├── 05-screenshot-requests.md ├── 06-article-integration.md ├── 07-next-actions.md ├── 08-worker-report.md ├── owned-paths.txt ├── diffs/ │ ├── 10-domain-reliability.patch │ ├── 20-app-reliability.patch │ ├── 30-context-preflight.patch │ ├── 40-agent-chat-ui.patch │ ├── 50-protocol-messages.patch │ └── 60-protocol-types.patch ├── receipts/ │ ├── 00-*.txt │ ├── V*.log │ └── R*.json └── runtime/ ├── commands-discovered.txt ├── request-payloads.jsonl └── result-index.md 01-path-accounting.tsv One row per owned path, in the exact order of owned-paths.txt: path group status added deleted hunk_count commit_count changed_symbols audit_state finding_ids evidence_refs notes Allowed audit_state values: UNREVIEWED STATIC_REVIEWED BEHAVIOR_PROVEN BOUNDARY_PROVEN NO_MATERIAL_CHANGE BLOCKED Completion requires exactly 53 data rows and zero UNREVIEWED rows. 03-findings.jsonl One JSON object per finding: JSON{ "id": "AI03-F001", "classification": "VerifiedImprovement | ConfirmedRegression | PlausibleRegression | UnprovenClaim | ProofGap | NeutralRefactor", "severity": "S0 | S1 | S2 | S3", "confidence": "C4 | C3 | C2 | C1 | C0", "path": "src/...", "symbol": "module::symbol", "branch_hunk": "diffs/40-agent